+Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 15:56:03 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH 03/11] libipa: camera_sensor_helper: Add Sony IMX371 helper
+
+The IMX371 analogue gain follows 1024 / (1024 - code), and its 10-bit
+black level is 0x40. Register a helper so IPAs operate in real gain units
+and use the correct black level instead of treating the register code as
+a linear gain multiplier.
+
+Signed-off-by: Lolren <loren.bufanu@gmail.com>
